OL,4,CParalympian charged with 11 counts of  
OL,5,Crape                                   
OL,6,GAn athlete who won a silver medal for  
OL,7,GBritain at the 2024 Paralympics in     
OL,8,GParis has been charged with 11 counts  
OL,9,Gof rape.                               
OL,11,FWheelchair basketball player Lee       
OL,12,FFryer, 26, from Pontefract, West       
OL,13,FYorkshire, faces 17 charges in total,  
OL,14,Fincluding voyeurism, intentional       
OL,15,Fstrangulation, assault and possession  
OL,16,Fof a class A drug, namely cocaine.     
